<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.10.7">
<l>ceñcol maṟaipporu ḷāki niṉṟa</l>
<l rend="indent">tēvarkaḷ nāyaka ṉēyem māṉē</l>
<l>eñcali leṉṉuṭai yiṉṉa mutē</l>
<l rend="indent">ēḻula kumuṭai yāyeṉ ṉappā</l>
<l>vañca vuruviṉ namaṉta markaḷ</l>
<l rend="indent">valintu nalinteṉṉaip paṟṟum pōtu</l>
<l>añcala meṉṟeṉṉaik kākka vēṇṭum</l>
<l rend="indent">araṅkat taravaṇaip paḷḷi yāṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Ruler of the gods who remains</l>
<l rend="indent">as the meaning of the Veda of perfect words! Our Lord!</l>
<l>My faultless sweet nectar!</l>
<l rend="indent">You who possess the seven worlds! My Father!</l>
<l>When Yama’s attendants with deceptive forms</l>
<l rend="indent">grab me, compel me and afflict me,</l>
<l>saying “don’t fear,” you must protect me,</l>
<l rend="indent">Sleeper on the serpent bed in Araṅkam!</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
